<mxfile host="drawio"><diagram id="mjb" name="MJB process vs TDMS"><mxGraphModel dx="1360" dy="1650" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1360" pageHeight="1650" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;M.J. Billones Transport: the real business process and the TDMS system follow the same steps&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1280" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read this:&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Left&lt;/b&gt; = what MJB does every day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Right&lt;/b&gt; = the screen in the system that records that same step. &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#2e7d32&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Green line&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; = the system follows the real step. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Colours show the stage: &lt;span style=&quot;background:#dae8fc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;planning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#d5e8d4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;trip&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#fff2cc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;billing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background:#f8cecc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;payment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="76" width="1280" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;What MJB does in real life&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#333333;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=none;fontSize=17;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="500" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;Where the system records it&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#333333;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=none;fontSize=17;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="160" width="540" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; The franchise company sends its order by email.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: franchise company&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="250" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; The commissary (plant) sends the loading schedule through Viber.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: commissary&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="380" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; MJB plans the trip: picks a truck big enough for the crates, the driver and helpers, the date, and the time to leave the garage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: MJB office&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="510" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt; The truck leaves the garage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: driver and helpers&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; At the commissary the truck is loaded, and the driver gets the Delivery Receipt (DR) and the franchise trip report.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: driver&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="770" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; The truck delivers the crates to each store.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: driver and helpers&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="900" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;b&gt;7.&lt;/b&gt; The trip report is filled in and brought back to the office.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: driver &amp;#8594; MJB office&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1030" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;b&gt;8.&lt;/b&gt; MJB prepares the Statement of Account (SOA), the bill for the client&#x27;s finished trips.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: MJB accounting&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1160" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;b&gt;9.&lt;/b&gt; MJB issues the Service Invoice.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: MJB accounting&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1290" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;10.&lt;/b&gt; The client pays and MJB gives a Collection Receipt.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;Who: MJB accounting&lt;/i&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1420" width="500" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;b&gt;1&amp;#8211;2. Not in the system&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Email and Viber stay as they are. The office types the details into the system at step 3." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="250" width="540" height="226" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;3. &amp;quot;New Dispatch Order&amp;quot; screen&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Choose the client, stores and crates. The system suggests a truck that fits and warns if it is too full; trucks and crew already booked are not offered. Choose driver, helpers, date and time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#333333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shows:&lt;/b&gt; Scheduled &amp;nbsp;&amp;#183;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Prints:&lt;/b&gt; Loading schedule&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="510" width="540" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Happens on its own&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;At the leaving time the system marks the trip as on the road. The truck and crew stay booked while the trip is out (up to 24 hours).&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#333333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shows:&lt;/b&gt; Current&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="640" width="540" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;b&gt;5. &amp;quot;Trip Report&amp;quot; screen (plant gate)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The time the truck entered and left the plant, who signed, and a scanned copy or photo of the franchise trip report." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="770" width="540" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="&lt;b&gt;6. &amp;quot;Trip Report&amp;quot; screen (stores)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;For each store: the DR numbers, crates delivered and empty crates returned, arrival and leaving time, and who received them." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="900" width="540" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;b&gt;7. &amp;quot;Trip Report&amp;quot; screen (save)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Saving the finished trip report closes the trip. If crates are missing, the system asks for a damage report first.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#333333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shows:&lt;/b&gt; Completed &amp;nbsp;&amp;#183;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Prints:&lt;/b&gt; Trip report&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="1030" width="540" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="&lt;b&gt;8. &amp;quot;Statement of Account&amp;quot; screen&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Picks the client&#x27;s finished trips and adds up the amount, fuel charge and taxes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#333333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shows:&lt;/b&gt; For Collection &amp;nbsp;&amp;#183;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Prints:&lt;/b&gt; Statement of Account&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="1160" width="540" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="&lt;b&gt;9. &amp;quot;Service Invoice&amp;quot; screen&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Made from the Statement of Account, with 15 days to pay. It waits in the &amp;quot;For collection&amp;quot; list until paid.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#333333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shows:&lt;/b&gt; For Collection&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="1290" width="540" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="&lt;b&gt;10. &amp;quot;Collection Receipt&amp;quot; screen&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Records the payment. The SOA, invoice and receipt are marked Paid and locked so nobody can change them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#333333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shows:&lt;/b&gt; Paid &amp;nbsp;&amp;#183;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Prints:&lt;/b&gt; Collection Receipt&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="1420" width="540" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c21" target="c22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c22" target="c23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c23" target="c24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c26" target="c27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c44" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c27" target="c28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c28" target="c29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c29" target="c30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c30" target="c31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c31" target="c32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c49" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c32" target="c33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value="typed in at step 3" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#777777;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c25" target="c26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="outside the system" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=none;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#777777;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.212;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="outside the system" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=none;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#777777;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.788;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c53" value="&amp;#10004; Same" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2e7d32;dashed=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2e7d32;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c54" value="&amp;#10004; Same" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2e7d32;dashed=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2e7d32;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c55" value="&amp;#10004; Same" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2e7d32;dashed=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2e7d32;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c56" value="&amp;#10004; Same" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2e7d32;dashed=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2e7d32;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c57" value="&amp;#10004; Same" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2e7d32;dashed=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2e7d32;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c21" target="c30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c58" value="&amp;#10004; Same" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2e7d32;dashed=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2e7d32;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c22" target="c31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c59" value="&amp;#10004; Same" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2e7d32;dashed=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2e7d32;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c23" target="c32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c60" value="&amp;#10004; Same" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2e7d32;dashed=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2e7d32;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c24" target="c33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c61" value="&lt;b&gt;Summary:&lt;/b&gt; 8 of the 10 steps are done in the system, in the same order as the real work. Only the first 2 (email and Viber) stay outside, and their details are typed in at step 3." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#2e7d32;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;align=center;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1550" width="1280" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>